---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Reality Code Engine: One Form, Many Fits, and the Low-Entropy Path to Autonomous Coding"
  description="About: The Reality Code Engine: One Form, Many Fits, and the Low-Entropy Path to Autonomous Coding. Research paper in the OpenIE research catalog."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Reality Code Engine: One Form, Many Fits, and the Low-Entropy Path to Autonomous Coding
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      The engineering and theory paper for the Reality Code Engine (RCE). There are two paths to autonomous computer automation. One generates every change and spends high energy resolving high entropy at run time. The other converges: people have already coded most of what will ever be coded, so the work is to retrieve a fit that exists, adapt it and prove it.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      A program is a database functional state machine: one Form, P = (S, E, δ, D, λ), and many fits. Gurevich's Abstract State Machine theorem grounds the Form. Human intent is high entropy, the machine floor is low entropy, and code converges by design. The engine runs its gears cheapest first, as one Mixture of Limits instance: there is a minimal amount of anything to accomplish a task, and any more is waste. Correctness is the gate. Joules are the ranking.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      RCE is one uniform code ecosystem with a lossless encoding of intent. Measured on 10,000 preregistered Forms with a frozen engine and 0 model calls: the Form round trips to identical bytes and every projection is deterministic on all 10,000, every malformed input and specification is refused at entry on all 10,000, and the Python projection replays the reference trace byte for byte on 9,999; Rust, WASM, XState and SCXML print the same trace in differential tests. Code from other languages enters by lift: on that entry path the engine repairs 520,541 of 520,821 one-token faults and 13,586 of 21,320 single-statement Java bugs (63.7%). The universality thesis, that one Form replaces the need for any other language, is stated with its conditions and a large N coverage protocol. measured_j is reserved for a wall meter.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2" id="companion">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Companion paper</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">The market and pricing argument is in the economics companion, <a href="/papers/ai-coding-market/" class="text-brand-cyan">The Promised Trillion Dollar AI-Coding Market</a> (<a href="/about/ai-coding-market/" class="text-brand-cyan">about</a>).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/rce/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper → /papers/rce/
